    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Reading this property’s value is equivalent to calling the `projectionMatrix(withViewportSize:orientation:zNear:zFar:)` method, using the camera’s [`imageResolution`](arcamera/imageresolution.md) and [`intrinsics`](arcamera/intrinsics.md) properties to derive size and orientation, and passing default values of `0.001` and `1000.0` for the near and far clipping planes.",
      "ko": "이 속성의 값을 읽으면 카메라의 [`imageResolution`](arcamera/imageresolution.md) 및 [`intrinsics`](arcamera/intrinsics.md) 속성을 사용해 크기와 방향을 유도하고, 근거리 및 원거리 클리핑 평면의 기본값으로 `0.001`, `1000.0`을 전달한 다음 `projectionMatrix(withViewportSize:orientation:zNear:zFar:)` 메서드를 호출한 것과 동일합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "5c2029aeb866f1f24becd7ae6013679cdde0daa4967247d6933b470ee6e19e89",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
